<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  English is the DEFAULT language (values/), Chinese lives in values-zh/.

  Why default English: Android falls back to values/ for any language that has no
  qualified folder. So whatever sits in values/ is what a Russian or Portuguese
  user sees — that is the "default language", no setting involved.

  Nothing here is cached: the host rebuilds its Activity on a locale change, the
  service is rebound, and getSettingsSchema() runs again. Keep every lookup at
  call time (see the guide, §14).
-->
